<!-- question: II6_Q1_comprimento_helice -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>II6_Q1_comprimento_helice</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Como no Exemplo 9.7 do notebook, calcule (com SymPy, integrando o módulo de <strong>r</strong>'(t)) o comprimento da hélice circular</p><p><strong>r</strong>(t) = (3cos t, 3sen t, 4t), &nbsp; 0 &le; t &le; 2&pi;</p><p>Qual é o valor exato do comprimento?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>10&pi;</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>5&pi;</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>20&pi;</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>25&pi;</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>

<!-- question: II6_Q2_curva_intersecao_ponto -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>II6_Q2_curva_intersecao_ponto</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Como no Exemplo 9.3 do notebook, considere a curva obtida pela interseção do cilindro x&sup2;+y&sup2;=1 com um plano, parametrizada por</p><p>x = cos t, &nbsp; y = sen t, &nbsp; z = 3 - 2sen t</p><p>Qual é o ponto (x, y, z) correspondente a t = &pi;/2?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(0, 1, 1)</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(0, 1, 3)</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(1, 0, 1)</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(0, -1, 1)</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>

<!-- question: II6_Q3_campo_gradiente_avaliacao -->
  <question type="multichoice">
